WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.980
Welcome to the 5678 user guide. You can select the steps training mode and select

00:07.980 --> 00:09.980
your steps that you'd like to train.

00:09.980 --> 00:14.980
Below you will see a GIF of the steps and a steps animation.

00:16.980 --> 00:19.960
You can select other steps and view the same information.

00:19.970 --> 00:24.960
Now you can enter the play mode.

00:24.970 --> 00:29.950
In the play mode you can select your mode and then your song,

00:29.950 --> 00:39.070
and then hit start. You can select play, pause and stop throughout your play.

00:39.930 --> 00:49.900
You can also select next and previous songs.

00:49.920 --> 00:52.500
[Upbeat music]

00:59.900 --> 01:03.900
Now we can enter the "Create new routine" mode.

01:03.900 --> 01:05.900
You can select your steps.

01:09.890 --> 01:12.890
Once you have selected them, you can hit finish.

01:13.890 --> 01:16.890
You can enter the play mode and play your creation.

01:17.000 --> 01:19.860
You can select your creation,

01:19.870 --> 01:24.670
your options and then hit start. You can play and pause in the same way as before.

01:24.670 --> 01:29.070
You can enter the history mode to view your current scores

01:29.850 --> 01:32.530
and the info mode to view this video.

01:33.970 --> 01:37.050
Get dancing, 5, 6, 7, 8.
